# ${name}

A Space Engineers 2 library mod: shared definitions and script code that other mods depend on, built with
se2-modkit.

## Layout

- `${vrgproj}`, `Assets/`: the mod project. Shared data definitions go in `Assets/` (a data-only placeholder for now).
- `Scripts/`: the shared C# code.
- `Tests/`: offline tests (`python -m pytest`).

## Status

How one SE2 mod depends on another (Workshop dependency, load order) and whether scripts can call across mods (a
shared assembly reference, or a message/API surface) is still open: the core-library spike works it out. Until it
reports, keep this mod data-only or its scripts self-contained, and do not rely on other mods calling into it.

